"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Two Turkish-program award options offer different cabin and timing trade-offs. Both require a separate SFO–LAX cash ticket; the quoted cash amounts have unknown scope, and repositioning permission and separate-ticket obligations are unverified. Both award quotes have unknown scope, tax amounts are unavailable, and support for the requested traveler count is unverified—so these amounts do not establish per-traveler or all-in trip costs.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J115@2027-01-08T08:40-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Business cabin; earlier departure\",\"v\":\"Consider if the reported business cabin is worth the 275,000-point quote. It departs 3h07 earlier than the economy option but arrives at the same time.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J18@2027-01-08T11:47-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Economy cabin; shorter elapsed time\",\"v\":\"Consider if economy suits you and the lower reported Turkish-program quote of 110,000 points appeals. It departs 3h07 later than the business option, arrives at the same time, and has 3h07 less elapsed time.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-08T06:05-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash reference\",\"v\":\"The SFO-to-BKK cash itinerary is quoted at USD 452.00, but its price scope is unknown.\"}]}"
